<view class="pb">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="hero-title">确认订单</view>
    <view class="hero-sub">支付成功后服务立即开通</view>
  </view>

  <view class="glass">
    <view class="line">
      <text class="title">{{title}}</text>
      <text class="price big">¥{{yuan}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="muted" wx:if="{{desc}}">{{desc}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="sec"><text class="sec-title">服务说明</text></view>
  <view class="glass notes">
    <view class="note"><text class="dot-g"></text>服务期内可在「服务」页自助预约通话</view>
    <view class="note"><text class="dot-g"></text>老师请假时，你可选择等待或更换代班老师</view>
    <view class="note"><text class="dot-g"></text>请通过平台完成沟通与支付，避免私下交易风险</view>
  </view>
</view>

<view class="bar">
  <view class="total">
    <text class="muted">合计</text>
    <text class="price">¥{{yuan}}</text>
  </view>
  <button class="btn pay-btn" disabled="{{paying || paid}}" bindtap="onTapPay">
    {{paid ? '已开启 ✓' : paying ? '正在开启…' : '立即开启'}}
  </button>
</view>
